00:16:27.387 --> 00:16:30.466
He's got razors!

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.049
Shoot him!

00:16:35.495 --> 00:16:38.021
Stop it!

00:17:01.087 --> 00:17:02.748
Hey!

00:17:13.433 --> 00:17:17.313
Take my green onions...
Take my green onions...

00:17:17.337 --> 00:17:21.365
Take my green onions! Take my green onions!

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:36.932
I'll forgive you for that because you're cute.

00:17:36.956 --> 00:17:41.237
What the hell are you doing?

00:17:41.261 --> 00:17:45.528
I can't believe you guys. I can't!

00:17:48.468 --> 00:17:50.562
We gotta call an ambulance!

00:17:58.411 --> 00:18:00.846
You got a problem with this, kiddo?

00:18:06.419 --> 00:18:10.199
This can't be right... It just can't be!

00:18:10.223 --> 00:18:12.468
What do you mean? You're strange.

00:18:12.492 --> 00:18:17.406
Yeah, we got caught up in the thrill
of it and bagged ourselves a weirdo.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:20.209
I couldn't save him.

00:18:20.233 --> 00:18:23.726
Damn it! I couldn't save him!

00:18:25.138 --> 00:18:27.383
Stuff it, you hypocrite!

00:18:27.407 --> 00:18:30.152
He wasn't even human!

00:18:30.176 --> 00:18:33.222
What difference does that make?

00:18:33.246 --> 00:18:36.158
But what are we going to do about this?

00:18:36.182 --> 00:18:37.927
Shit! Someone saw us!

00:18:37.951 --> 00:18:39.395
Hey! Call the police!

00:18:39.419 --> 00:18:44.414
--What the fuck are you saying?
--Mom! The Saitos' house is all messed up!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:50.506
It looks like she didn't see us.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.675
I guess that means we really are...

00:18:52.699 --> 00:18:55.066
...dead...

00:19:11.751 --> 00:19:14.448
Who the fuck is this?

00:19:18.057 --> 00:19:20.502
The Greenonion Alien's dad?

00:19:20.526 --> 00:19:22.771
Say something, you fucking green onion man!

00:19:22.795 --> 00:19:24.907
Stop! I'm not exactly sure,

00:19:24.931 --> 00:19:26.942
but I don't think it's a good idea
to get him any more agitated!

00:19:26.966 --> 00:19:28.477
Shut up, kid!

00:19:28.501 --> 00:19:30.196
What?

00:19:32.071 --> 00:19:35.769
What the fuck are you looking at?

00:19:43.149 --> 00:19:45.948
Are we gonna die?

00:19:47.487 --> 00:19:49.854
This might be the end for us.

00:20:00.934 --> 00:20:03.699
What is he made of, concrete?

00:20:05.338 --> 00:20:07.306
Shoot him! Now!

00:20:10.043 --> 00:20:12.154
Wait!

00:20:12.178 --> 00:20:14.442
Don't shoot!

00:20:17.583 --> 00:20:18.727
Okay...

00:20:18.751 --> 00:20:21.652
<i>'m sorry, I'm sorry...</i>

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.334
Hey, kid!

00:20:25.358 --> 00:20:29.761
You still going to tell us to stop
even when it comes to this?

00:20:47.213 --> 00:20:51.150
I told you not to shoot!

00:20:52.251 --> 00:20:54.396
I'm sorry.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:58.434
Would you shoot one of your
kids if he didn't listen to you?!

00:20:58.458 --> 00:21:00.769
--Well?
--I'm sorry!

00:21:00.793 --> 00:21:03.605
--Well?!
--I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:21:03.629 --> 00:21:07.042
It won't work on me.

00:21:07.066 --> 00:21:10.092
I will live through this!

00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:29.916
Hajimari wa dare demo junshin muku na baby

00:21:34.394 --> 00:21:41.425
Nigai mi kajitte mo
kujikecha dame yo walk straight

00:21:45.972 --> 00:21:53.972
Satta koto da kedo
ame no naka zukizuki itamu yo

00:22:00.086 --> 00:22:02.331
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:22:02.355 --> 00:22:07.169
Yaseta yubi ni kiss o shite

00:22:07.193 --> 00:22:13.876
Naita anata o omoidasu yo

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:18.747
Kore de owari da to shite mo

00:22:18.771 --> 00:22:23.652
Saigo no kiss wa wasurenai yo

00:22:23.676 --> 00:22:31.676
Wasurenai yo... Wasurenai yo...

00:22:35.588 --> 00:22:38.588
Kare no kiss o wasurenai yo
